#!/bin/sh
# Spec 123 R-R (2026-08-29): re-runs step:validate + typecheck at push time so a
# committer who used `git commit --no-verify` cannot ALSO push without them —
# defeats the "skip once, push anyway" bypass a pre-commit-only gate leaves open.
# `--staged` reads the last commit's changed files (via `git diff --cached`,
# which pre-push's own worktree state reflects post-commit) — same scoping
# rationale as pre-commit: gate what THIS push actually touches, never the
# entire historical fleet (see step-validate.mjs's own `filterToStaged` doc).
# Direct `node` invocation (not `npm run`) — measured 2026-08-29: npm's own CLI
# wrapper adds real overhead on top of the script's own <1s budget.
#
# Spec 124 R-AG (2026-09-14): pre-commit now runs only `vitest related`,
# scoped to each commit's own staged files — the FULL Vitest suite runs HERE
# instead, once per push (gating a whole landed group rather than every
# commit), and still runs in CI (test.yml) as the non-skippable backstop.
# Capped at ONE fork (VITEST_MAX_FORKS — the variable vitest's default `forks`
# pool actually reads; VITEST_MAX_WORKERS is NOT read by vitest, measured
# 2026-09-14). Was 2 until 2026-09-16 (I5 cutover): at two forks the 498-test
# step-conformance suite dies on `[vitest-worker]: Timeout calling "onTaskUpdate"`
# with ZERO test failures — 4 pre-commit attempts and then this push, deterministic;
# at one fork it passes. Matches the pre-commit `vitest related` cap and the
# hook-history lesson (a 4-fork run was OS-killed for low memory, tasks/lessons.md).
#
# Fold GC-4 (2026-09-25, gate G Ask 2 ruling) — `--staged --fast` alone never
# catches a `scripts/lib/step/**` change whose ripple lands on a step NOT
# touched by this push's own commits: a golden capture's `lib_fingerprint`
# `mismatch` state (gate G #39) is RED under `--all` with or without a ledger
# row, so it must be caught here, fleet-wide, before the push completes —
# `--staged`'s job is scoping what commit-time gates apply to; it is not a
# substitute for the fleet-wide freshness sweep. Measured 2026-09-26: ~19s.
node scripts/analysis/step-validate.mjs --staged --fast && node scripts/analysis/step-validate.mjs --all --fast && node scripts/analysis/spec-split-check.mjs --check && npm run typecheck && VITEST_MIN_FORKS=1 VITEST_MAX_FORKS=1 npm run test
